silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_07_yoneda_profile_drill_sections_03_full_and_faithful_embedding_yoneda_hom_leg a owl:NamedIndividual ;
    rdfs:label "FullAndFaithfulEmbeddingYonedaHomLegExample" .
silm:instances_papers_00_whitepaper_chapters_07_yoneda_profile_drill_sections_03_full_and_faithful_embedding_yoneda_hom_leg silm:hasExample "In 'FullAndFaithfulEmbeddingYonedaHomLeg', the typed legs of the Yoneda hom-profile are witnessed by concrete Mittens-domain arrows. For example, In 'Full and Faithful Embedding', the colimit_factorization_arrow VetCarePlan_77 -> MittensColimitApex: VetCarePlan_77 receives all twelve D_Mittens source legs (it is a cone) so by the colimit universal property there is a unique arrow to MittensColimitApex; this arrow is not monic (VetCarePlan_77 might identify some distinctions that MittensColimitApex preserves)." .
